# Local debug / smoke scripts — never commit these. They tend to carry
# hardcoded credentials: a `smoke_s3_check.php` with IDrive E2 keys WAS committed
# here and had to be removed (see deploy/BACKUP.md). If you need a one-off probe,
# read credentials from the environment instead of inlining them.
smoke_*.php
*_smoke.php
